        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"19781735-5ee7-414a-a034-bc33ccf91101\",\"review_text\":\"It was good but it frustrating me I'm paying and now you know the lyrics I can't copy anymore and yeah I miss a payment that I paid did I get charged again a couple days\"},{\"review_id\":\"ba55a565-60d9-40b7-96e3-80995c6e7cef\",\"review_text\":\"Ezzzz\"},{\"review_id\":\"3694cbca-4c67-4afb-b40c-57d2454134ba\",\"review_text\":\"Trash app. Unusable without subscription\"},{\"review_id\":\"4ee98e5b-0140-4d95-973a-17eceb913869\",\"review_text\":\"Best streaming service out there!\"},{\"review_id\":\"117cc256-0c7b-49e5-8117-f58f08080682\",\"review_text\":\"Disappointed....Seriously?! Premium for repeating songs too now?! Would they now even charge premium for just logging in too?! This is absurd like if you can't even repeat a song,shuffle a playlist or rewind a song it's just a force to listen music...Youtube Music is better\"},{\"review_id\":\"ad371f8c-74ef-4a51-b64a-d86456986874\",\"review_text\":\"It's god\"},{\"review_id\":\"371fcb4b-7ed3-4cdc-9b63-8501bac4eee9\",\"review_text\":\"What happened spotify? I loved using this app and I loved listening to the music but now it dosent show lyrics, I can't repeat songs which is litteraly what I do 40% of the time on spotify and I just cant use the app, if this is your way of getting people to buy premium, I'd say it's a sad excuse to just get more money. Bring back the old spotify! The spotify that everyone loved using! The one that you could acctually use! And not have to listen to millions of ads and acctually be able to use!\"},{\"review_id\":\"0b5db00e-a562-4125-897e-3e73937b53bf\",\"review_text\":\"DEAR DEVELOPER, WE NEED A CHAT FEATURE ON SPOTIFYY\"},{\"review_id\":\"3747b174-6fe8-452a-9394-05d2e04e80f0\",\"review_text\":\"Not best very very ad\"},{\"review_id\":\"1970fa98-ddbe-4a34-9155-bb34c66c2f99\",\"review_text\":\"Not able to log in with phone number it's saying \\\" Check your mobile number\\\" But mobile number is correct please fix this\"}]}"
